<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Physicians Resource cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Physicians Resource cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Bros analyst Lawrence Marsh said in a research note he lowered his recommendation on Physicians Resource Group Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-1/4 to 10-5/8 in late morning New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
